    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Embarquement: Egypte - Le Caire, le renouveau du quartier de Darb Al-Ahmar features ISMC's Professor Pradines and looks at Cairo - Africa's second most populated city and examines its rich history centring on the Darb Al Ahmar quarter.  Professor Pradines has led a number of excavations in Cairo most notably as Director of Excavations of the Walls of Cairo.",
